To estimate the critical size  d C  below which no brittle behavior occurs, the yield strength  σ Y  and the fracture strength  σ F  of martensite must be equated. The yield strength is described using the Hall–Petch relationship (Eq.  1 ) [ 26 ], and the fracture strength is obtained from a modified Griffith equation (Eq.  2 ) [ 27 ].
